{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/layout\/makecache(subviews:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"makeCache","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"subviews","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Subviews","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP8Subviewsa","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Subviews"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cache","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP5CacheQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Cache"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"subviews","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A collection of proxy instances that represent the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"views that the container arranges. You can use the proxies in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collection to get information about the subviews as you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calculate values to store in the cache."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Storage for calculated data that you share among"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the methods of your custom layout container."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can optionally use a cache to preserve calculated values across"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls to a layout container’s methods. Many layout types don’t need"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a cache, because OpenSwiftUI automatically reuses both the results of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls into the layout and the values that the layout reads from its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subviews. Rely on the protocol’s default implementation of this method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if you don’t need a cache."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"However you might find a cache useful when:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The layout container repeats complex, intermediate calculations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"across calls like ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/sizeThatFits(proposal:subviews:cache:)"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/placeSubviews(in:proposal:subviews:cache:)"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"explicitAlignment(of:in:proposal:subviews:cache:)-8ofeu","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You might be able to improve performance by calculating values","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"once and storing them in a cache.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The layout container reads many ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LayoutValueKey"},{"text":" values from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"subviews. It might be more efficient to do that once and store the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"results in the cache, rather than rereading the subviews’ values before","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each layout call.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You want to maintain working storage, like temporary Swift arrays,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"across calls into the layout, to minimize the number of allocation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"events.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only implement a cache if profiling shows that it improves performance."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Initialize-a-cache","level":3,"text":"Initialize a cache"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCache(subviews:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method to create a cache."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can add computed values to the cache right away, using information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subviews"},{"type":"text","text":" input parameter, or you can do that later. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"methods of the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol that can access the cache"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"take the cache as an in-out parameter, which enables you to modify"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the cache anywhere that you can read it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use any storage type that makes sense for your layout"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithm, but be sure that you only store data that you derive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the layout and its subviews (lazily, if possible). For this to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"work correctly, OpenSwiftUI needs to be able to call this method to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recreate the cache without changing the layout result."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you return a cache from this method, you implicitly define a type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for your cache. Be sure to either make the type of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cache"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameters on your other "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol methods match, or use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a type alias to define the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Cache","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" associated type."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Update-the-cache","level":3,"text":"Update the cache"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the layout container or any of its subviews change, OpenSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"updateCache(_:subviews:)-9hkj9"},{"type":"text","text":" method so you can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modify or invalidate the contents of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache. The default implementation of that method calls the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCache(subviews:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method to recreate the cache, but you can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provide your own implementation of the update method to take an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"incremental approach, if appropriate."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"defaultImplementationsSections":[{"title":"Layout Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/makeCache(subviews:)-2ml4x"],"anchor":"Layout-Implementations"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"makeCache"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subviews"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP8Subviewsa","text":"Subviews"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP5CacheQa","text":"Cache"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP9makeCache8subviews0F0QzAA0D8SubviewsV_tF","required":true,"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"makeCache(subviews:)","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates and initializes a cache for a layout instance."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/makeCache(subviews:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Layout/makeCache(subviews:)-2ml4x":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the empty value when your layout doesn’t require a cache."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Cache","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"identifier":"doc:\/\